1
00:00:00,568 --> 00:00:04,368
(Raj:)-How could you not put in an abort?
-I made a boo-boo, all right?

2
00:00:04,531 --> 00:00:08,871
I think the board will really appreciate
how well we're using that NSA grant.

3
00:00:09,035 --> 00:00:12,125
(Leonard:)Right here
we have a micro-controlled plasma--

4
00:00:18,962 --> 00:00:22,552
(Bernadette:)Wow.
Looks like the Ganges on laundry day.

5
00:00:24,634 --> 00:00:26,384
(Leonard:)At least they don't know it was you.

6
00:00:27,053 --> 00:00:29,473
SHELDON [OVER COMPUTER]:
Hello, Kripke.

7
00:00:29,639 --> 00:00:31,889
(Sheldon(on Kripke's computer in the lab):)This classic prank comes to you...

8
00:00:32,058 --> 00:00:35,728
(Sheldon(on Kripke's computer in the lab):)...from the malevolent mind
of Sheldon Cooper.

9
00:00:35,895 --> 00:00:38,735
(Sheldon(on Kripke's computer in the lab):)If you'd like to see the look
on your stupid face...

10
00:00:38,898 --> 00:00:42,738
(Sheldon(on Kripke's computer in the lab):)...this video is being instantly uploaded
to YouTube.

11
00:00:42,902 --> 00:00:47,742
(Sheldon(on Kripke's computer in the lab):)Oh, and a hat tip to Leonard Hofstadter
and Raj Koothrappali...

12
00:00:47,907 --> 00:00:52,497
(Sheldon(on Kripke's computer in the lab):)...for their support and encouragement
in this enterprise.

13
00:00:53,955 --> 00:01:02,025
(Raj:)Well, I'm going back to India.
What's your plan?

